":"Audio/Voice/uni00007_1/uni00007_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"淫魔に見えないですって！？　い、今おっぱい見て言ったなー！？","en":"You say I don't look like a succubus!? I-I just saw your boobs!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00007_1/uni00007_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"え？　ご飯くれるの？　わーい……て、私が欲しいのは普通のご飯じゃなくてあなたの生気なの！","en":"Eh? You're giving me food? Yay… but what I actually want isn't normal food, it's your life force!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00007_1/uni00007_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"あーあ、暇だよ～……よ～し、なんかイタズラ考えよ♪","en":"Ahh, I'm bored… alright, time to think up some mischief♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00007_1/uni00007_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"むにゃむにゃ、んへへ、もう食べられない……♪　はっ！？　わ、私が夢見ても仕方ないじゃない！","en":"Munya munya, hehe, I can't eat any more…♪ Huh!? Well, there's no point in me dreaming!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00007_1/uni00007_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"ふふふ、この美少女淫魔のリリムちゃんにかかれば、誰だってエッチな夢を見て骨抜きになっちゃうんだから♪","en":"Hehehe, if this cute succubus Lilim-chan gets you, anyone will end up having a lewd dream and be completely drained♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00007_1/uni00007_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"このリリムちゃんが生気を食べてあげる♪　光栄に思いなさい♪","en":"Let Lilim-chan eat your life force♪ Be honored!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00007_1/uni00007_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00007_1/uni00007_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00007_1/uni00007_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00007_1/uni00007_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Au